stages.prompt_template:
Create a detailed image generation prompt based on the following inputs:

Subject: {{SUBJECT}}
Environment: {{ENVIRONMENT}}
Style: {{STYLE}}
Lighting: {{LIGHTING}}
Camera Angle: {{CAMERA_ANGLE}}
Aspect Ratio: {{ASPECT_RATIO}}

Format the prompt with:
1. Detailed subject description including pose, expression, clothing
2. Environment/setting with atmosphere
3. Technical specs (lighting, camera, style)
4. Quality tags for best results

Output ONLY the prompt, nothing else.
